  "content": {
    "id": "p57-q33-group-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "9",
    "prompt": "Rationalise the denominator and simplify.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p57-q33-root",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac3{\\sqrt5}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{3\\sqrt5}{5}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac3{\\sqrt5}&=\\frac3{\\sqrt5}\\times\\frac{\\sqrt5}{\\sqrt5}\\\\\\frac3{\\sqrt5}&=\\frac{3\\sqrt5}{5}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 22
      },
      {
        "id": "p57-q34-root",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac7{\\sqrt7}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\sqrt7$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac7{\\sqrt7}&=\\frac7{\\sqrt7}\\times\\frac{\\sqrt7}{\\sqrt7}\\\\\\frac7{\\sqrt7}&=\\frac{7\\sqrt7}{7}\\\\\\frac7{\\sqrt7}&=\\sqrt7.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      },
      {
        "id": "p57-q35-root",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac2{3-\\sqrt3}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$1+\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{3}$.\n\nMultiply numerator and denominator by the conjugate $3+\\sqrt3$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac2{3-\\sqrt3}&=\\frac2{3-\\sqrt3}\\times\\frac{3+\\sqrt3}{3+\\sqrt3}\\\\\\frac2{3-\\sqrt3}&=\\frac{2(3+\\sqrt3)}{9-3}\\\\\\frac2{3-\\sqrt3}&=\\frac{3+\\sqrt3}{3}\\\\\\frac2{3-\\sqrt3}&=1+\\frac{\\sqrt3}{3}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 40
      },
      {
        "id": "p57-q36-root",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac5{\\sqrt7-\\sqrt5}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac52(\\sqrt7+\\sqrt5)$.\n\nMultiply numerator and denominator by the conjugate $\\sqrt7+\\sqrt5$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac5{\\sqrt7-\\sqrt5}&=\\frac5{\\sqrt7-\\sqrt5}\\times\\frac{\\sqrt7+\\sqrt5}{\\sqrt7+\\sqrt5}\\\\\\frac5{\\sqrt7-\\sqrt5}&=\\frac{5(\\sqrt7+\\sqrt5)}{7-5}\\\\\\frac5{\\sqrt7-\\sqrt5}&=\\frac52(\\sqrt7+\\sqrt5).\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      }
    ]
  },
